  {
   "text": "Samuel \"Sam\" Stoddard (ab. 1981) is a former senior Magic developer for Wizards of the Coast .",
   "scene": 0,
   "section": ""
  },
  {
   "text": "As an administrator from Columbus, Ohio, he cashed multiple Grand Prix , played in seven Pro Tours and was a vocal advocate for Legacy in his column on StarCityGames.com . Sam joined WotC as an intern in June 2012, and was permanently hired in December of that year. Until June 2017, Sam was the main columnist for Latest Developments and also contributed some stories to Uncharted Realms .",
   "scene": 1,
   "section": "Career"
  },
  {
   "text": "Sam Stoddard left Wizards of the Coast in March 2019, to become Senior Game Designer at Mythical Games .",
   "scene": 1,
   "section": "Career"
  },
